DESCRIPTION:The new version of Django has several important features that a
 llow us to avoid installing additional modules. Libraries like DRF\, yasg\
 , spectacular have always been recommended for REST API development. Now t
 he rules have changed. In this workshop: \n1. The modern art of project de
 velopment in Django. (µ-Django style). \n2. Built-in serializer tools. \n
 3. Json response\, an underrated tool. \n4. Async ORM and class based view
 s . The best parts of modern Django.\n\nAfter this workshop\, all particip
 ants got information about the new features of Django.
